WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.778
In tutorial 5.9, you'll tick off the changes
only you can make on your own website.

00:00:12.798 --> 00:00:17.383
First, on your Pipeline, every step
on your website shows up in Needs you.

00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:19.404
Click Open the step to jump to it.

00:00:20.389 --> 00:00:22.539
Steps on your website lists them all.

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:27.137
The IndexNow file tells Bing and
Copilot about your new pages sooner.

00:00:28.122 --> 00:00:32.076
And a redirect keeps the value of
links that point to an old page.

00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:37.426
Each step shows what to add. Click
Copy, then paste it on your website,

00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:39.344
or send it to whoever runs it.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:44.247
Not sure how? Click Show me how
for a guide, one step at a time.

00:00:45.809 --> 00:00:49.459
Then click I've done it, check now.
We look at your website at once,

00:00:49.509 --> 00:00:50.964
and tell you what we found.

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:56.390
We also check every day on our own,
and tick a step off once it's done.

00:00:57.809 --> 00:01:01.084
Like this one: AI search
crawlers can read your site,

00:01:01.134 --> 00:01:03.789
so assistants can name
and cite your pages.

00:01:04.804 --> 00:01:07.699
Don't need a step? Click Skip
to move it off your list,

00:01:07.749 --> 00:01:09.396
and Bring it back to restore it.

00:01:10.829 --> 00:01:15.074
So: open the step, copy what to
add, use Show me how, check it now,

00:01:15.124 --> 00:01:16.549
and skip what you don't need.

00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:22.683
Your website steps, checked for you.
Next, see every page from written to live,

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:24.567
in tutorial 6.1.
